{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《玫瑰戰爭》片尾曲《大娛樂家》MV近日曝光，三位女主角林夏薇、姚子羚及傅嘉莉竟齊齊以衝擊性「濕髮Look」上陣，畫面極為震撼！網民睇完紛紛錯重點，笑指似足洗頭水廣告，更有人發現姚子羚眉毛超搶戲，究竟這個破格造型背後，是否暗藏驚人寓意？\n</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉首獻聲圓夢 親解濕身look暗藏女星赤裸悲歌</h2>\n<p>MV中三人投入獻唱，但最搶眼的莫過於其「出浴」般的濕髮造型。對於首次為劇集獻聲、坦言夢想成真的傅嘉莉（Kelly）來說，這個造型其實蘊含特別意義。她受訪時親自解畫：「點解會攞咁嘅角度嚟拍 MV 哩，其實係想帶出女藝人喺鏡頭面前其實好赤裸、冇乜私隱，好多嘢都畀人睇晒。所以我哋會以好似沖緊涼嘅造型出現，頭髮又有少少濕咁。」總監製佳導亦補充，直指「每個女藝人做呢行就等於赤裸面對觀眾，因為事無大小都會暴露喺大眾目光之下。」佳導更預告MV稍後將推出「惡搞版」，並大賣關子：「好好笑架！」</p>\n<h2>姚子羚提議組「玫瑰組合」爭新人獎 網民力撐有望成真</h2>\n<p>雖然MV造型引起熱議，但林夏薇、姚子羚及傅嘉莉首次合體獻唱，歌喉卻獲網民普遍受落。不少人對她們的歌聲感到驚喜，認為水準甚高。姚子羚早前出席公開活動時，更順應民意，透露三人可以組成「玫瑰組合」，並笑言要角逐樂壇新人組合獎。如果這個臨時組合真的成事，相信必定會成為城中熱話，甚至有望成為電視圈的經典跨界組合，令粉絲相當期待。</p>\n<h2>網民錯重點熱議洗頭水廣告 姚子羚被指條眉好忙</h2>\n<p>MV一出，網民的焦點完全被三位女主角的濕髮造型吸引，留言區瞬間被洗版！大批網民錯重點笑言似廣告：「點解洗完頭唔吹頭？」、「可以考慮做洗頭水廣告」、「好想幫佢哋吹乾個頭。」當中姚子羚更因太投入獻唱，眉毛不停上下郁動，被網民截圖戲稱：「姚子羚條眉好忙！」不過，亦有大量網民大讚歌曲本身：「真係佢哋唱架？唱得好好聽喎」、「估唔到幾好聽」、「聲音好好聽」、「可以組女團」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_5490142316af400b635a1d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_5490142316af400b635a1d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_3434215546af400b90b98d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_3434215546af400b90b98d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_14373574226af400ad72783.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_14373574226af400ad72783.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_20093619966af400b0cbd0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_20093619966af400b0cbd0a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_11494469976af400b369d35.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_11494469976af400b369d35.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_10076111566af400a46d263.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_10076111566af400a46d263.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_8257109646af400a73d4fb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_8257109646af400a73d4fb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_8864398696af400aa0306b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_8864398696af400aa0306b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.189694+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1084,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:48:47.820442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:18.679372+00:00","content_hash":"bed750de4ec2a14f64034751845b3febd5209cd3eb29a432caaaa7bb02c02194","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}